{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0465eb49a0282d8a1f9a29f0e5f975e3eb0f4aafdc9885adaa2b1184482478f9", "ja": "亜利沙、お疲れさま！　ブログ、読んだぞ。", "zh": "亚利沙，辛苦了！你的部落格我看过了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "c8db7faa45b91871d70ca27c065873d6969b360b2c5479a6659670584cd3be53", "ja": "{$P$}さん、読んでくれたんですね！\nその……どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生已经看过了啊！\n那个……你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a56a89a2c070eff8bd32e392c6dc794c3440ab83af9b0d3504dfc196b5e40771", "ja": "亜利沙の情熱が伝わる、いい文章だったと思うよ。\n特にこの、『両方の景色が好き』ってとこなんか……。", "zh": "我觉得内容很棒，感受得到亚利沙的热情。\n特别是你写了『喜欢两边的景色』的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "f90047034514c2f4fe9bf9a4edf40816be883dff821084db9c482fdddc256add", "ja": "ひゃぁあああっ！！？　{$P$}さん、\n読み上げるのはダメです！　照れちゃいます～っ！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！？{$P$}先生，\n不可以念出来啦！很难为情耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b57c86a3f7c37fd3ab137897a739f579106d34a5cc39cbd99e0563d4bd3fe87e", "ja": "はは、そうか。ごめんごめん。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊，抱歉抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "646f5b064803815e02e625a85f0b0a8e12e42e6bfe7f13b7199406653b8fb337", "ja": "あの～、{$P$}さん。ありさの\nステージ、正統派と個性派どっちだったと思いますか？", "zh": "那个～{$P$}先生，\n你觉得亚利沙的表演，应该归在正统派还是个性派？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7d33210f0bc6c61e415e52e90ab8ae5a77503d9d693f6daf79a6e2829c73629a", "ja": "そうだな。あえて言えば……正統派でも\n個性派でもない、亜利沙だけのステージだったよ。", "zh": "这个嘛，真要说的话……我觉得既不是正统派\n也不是个性派，而就是亚利沙风格的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "a4845b6ae48ff6318b858ae8d6abeb1f20ed1922e1f97a466977f4a19b738162", "ja": "あ、ありさだけの……ステージ。\nそ、そうなんですね……えへへ……♪", "zh": "亚、亚利沙风格的……表演。\n这、这样啊……嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "b866adfd20f18235467004a3019c7b94868f48cfb289c648b916c1dcadcacde8", "ja": "{$P$}さん。ありさは……ありさも、\nす、素敵なアイドルちゃんになれると思いますか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你觉得亚利沙……\n亚利沙也能成、成为出色的偶像宝贝吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0dea1d6033bc39ceea7ab8fbe01f49effd72d55dbcf2d1218000f5c3fc3fa13f", "ja": "もちろん！　それを信じてなかったら、\n亜利沙のプロデュースをしてないと思う。", "zh": "当然可以！如果我不这么觉得，\n又怎么会培育亚利沙呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1010_p", "source_sha256": "26dec0e9ee7967a3878575a31009cecc5eaa4eb7dd2e47311b5715bd3620f0b7", "ja": "だから、これからも一緒に頑張ろうな！　亜利沙。", "zh": "所以，今后也继续一起加油吧！亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_024_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_024_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "52a6deffee6ae0cfb9f2c8dc774b5ee805fdb47e6072988785bbd7dbbd592246", "ja": "{$P$}さん……はいっ！　ありさ、\nこれからも、がんばりますよぉ～！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……好的！\n亚利沙以后也会继续加油的～！唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
